      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MULWEE JAFFA (1) goes very well this trip starting eight times for three wins and two minors. Below best last time at Gosford (22.82) in a Grade 5, finishing a 6 length fifth. Makes strong appeal on best. FLY HIGH SUE (8) flew the lids off the inside draw with a fast early split and gave a sight, finishing a 3 length third (22.47) over 388m at Gosford. Overdue and expected to feature again. GIDDY UP GLADYS (2) finished sixth last time but the start prior broke the clock when winning over 300m at this track, taking a Grade 5 in an exceptional 17.16. Has the ability and looks a key chance. TIGER'S GAMBIT (4) is a last-start placegetter with solid claims again.",
